### Create director
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/user/directors
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "name": "Christopher Nolan",
  "country": "United Kingdom",
  "win_oscar": true,
  "oscar_winner_title": "Oppenheimer"
}

### Get directors
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/user/directors
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
